# loc_2AA8, an enemy's blow: (0-63 + $44 + attack) << 8, divu by
# defense x 5 + 100, then mulu.w by the attack and lsr.w #8 -- the low
# word of the product shifted, so a strong enemy against light armour
# wraps. Build 71 fixed the port, which shifted the whole product.
#
# Formation 213 is one Archdragon (attack 254, no technique). Rolf at
# L30 has 213 HP; his defense set to 24 by hand, the ROM's blow is
# 115-188 and the unwrapped one 367-439. The first blow lands before
# tick 139 and the second after 319 (FIGHT repeats the round until a
# button), so HP is read at 200: 25-98 left, where the unwrapped blow
# kills him.

start battle 213
party 1 30
defense 0 24
wait idle
press c                      # FIGHT
wait ticks 200
expect hp 0 25 98
shot 01_first_blow
